Zeile 0: 0.05-2.71  Why you should never buy a festival ticket from an Instagram ad.
Zeile 1: 2.81-8.86  In 2017, famous models promoted Fyre Festival, a luxury party in the Bahamas.
Zeile 2: 8.96-11.87  It promised luxury villas and gourmet meals.
Zeile 3: 11.97-15.40  VIP packages with flights cost twelve thousand dollars.
Zeile 4: 15.50-20.32  But when the guests arrived, they found disaster-relief tents and soaking-wet mattresses.
Zeile 5: 20.42-23.18  And dinner was a cheese sandwich in a foam box!
